Rebased on ps3recomp v0.17.0 (SPU pass 95): partly absorbed: CreateTask's claim is #381's spu_taskset_mark_running, the elf flag mask is upstream's.
SPU pass 96: spu_taskset_dispatch sets s_ts_held around spu_workload_dispatch_async: #381 made dispatch_async call
spu_taskset_mark, which took ts_lock again on the same thread (non-recursive spinlock), so the first cellSpursCreateTask
hung the main thread forever (v0.17.0 boot check: 0 flips).

